# LOTS (Lloyds Online Trade Services) - Client Side Administration Reference Guide

**Version 1.0 (Beginner Friendly)**

---

# 1. First understand where LOTS fits

```text
Customer (Wipro)

↓

LOTS (Customer Portal)

↓

TACC (Translator/Interface Layer)

↓

TAE (Fusion Trade Innovation)

↓

Lloyds Back Office
```

**Simple explanation:**

* Customer logs into LOTS
* Customer creates Trade Finance transactions
* LOTS sends data to TACC
* TACC converts messages into TAE format
* TAE processes transactions

---

