# 5. Entity Maintenance

### Purpose

Maintain business entities/departments.

### Example

Wipro has:

```text
Wipro Imports

Wipro Exports

Wipro Treasury
```

These become entities.

### Why?

Transactions belong to an entity.

Example:

```text
Import LC

↓

Entity = Wipro Imports
```

---

# 6. Jurisdiction Maintenance

### Purpose

Maintain countries/regions.

### Example

```text
India

USA

Singapore

UK
```

### Why?

Different countries have different trade rules.

---

# 7. User Maintenance

### Purpose

