# 8. Roles

### Purpose

Control permissions.

### Practical example

| Role         | Permission          |
| ------------ | ------------------- |
| Maker        | Create transactions |
| Checker      | Verify transactions |
| Release User | Final approval      |
| Viewer       | Read only           |

